    "• Access: View and download your personal data" : {

    },
    "• Access: View and download your personal data\n• Correction: Update or correct inaccurate information\n• Deletion: Request deletion of your personal data\n• Portability: Receive your data in a structured format" : {

    },
    "• Account Data: Until account deletion or 3 years of inactivity\n• Uploaded Content: Podcasts, playlists, and reposts remain until you delete them or account is closed\n• RSS Feed Data: Subscription information and imported episodes until subscription is removed\n• Comments and Replies: Until deleted by you or when associated content is removed\n• Direct Messages: Until conversation is deleted or 1 year of inactivity\n• Analytics and Usage Data: Up to 2 years in aggregated, anonymized form\n• Preference Data: Stored for personalization until account deletion or reset" : {

    },
    "• Account Deletion: Complete removal of personal data\n• Content Deletion: Removal of specific content upon request\n• Data Export: Right to receive your data in portable format" : {

    },
    "• Account Information: Username, email address, full name, profile image, bio, and links\n• Authentication Data: Firebase authentication tokens and session information" : {

    },
    "• Basic account information (username, email)" : {

    },
