    "• Firebase/Google: For authentication, Firestore database, Cloud Storage (audio files, images), push notifications (FCM), and analytics\n• Cloud Infrastructure: For hosting, content delivery (CDN), and media processing\n• AI/ML Services: For content recommendations and personalization algorithms\n• Third-party vendors: For specific technical services, email delivery, and platform operations" : {

