    "• Moderate content and enforce community guidelines using automated filters (including profanity detection) and human review\n• Filter inappropriate language in usernames, profiles, podcast content, tags, comments, and messages\n• Detect and prevent fraud, abuse, spam, and security threats\n• Process user reports and handle content violations\n• Ensure platform safety and user protection\n• Comply with legal obligations, law enforcement requests, and regulatory requirements (GDPR, CCPA, COPPA)" : {

