    },
    "• Preferences: Category weights, keyword interactions, mood preferences, and personalized content recommendations\n• Activity Data: Last interaction timestamps, listening history, engagement metrics (likes, comments, plays), search queries, and content discovery patterns\n• Notification Settings: Push notification preferences, quiet hours, and notification delivery tokens (FCM)\n• RSS Subscriptions: RSS feed URLs, imported episodes, and subscription management data" : {

